{"3383970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ryo And Gears", "steam_appid": 3383970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place in a world where machines roam the planet, where humans are rare to come by. Ryo is small humanoid robot tasked by its owner to retrieve six mythical circuits scattered across lands and seas. As Ryo's journey goes on, perhaps a truth unbeknownst will reveal itself, questioning the very purpose of Ryo's journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight a variety of foes divided into 5 chapters, each in a unique environment, most starting with easier enemies and ending with a boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ryo has but <i><strong>one hit point</strong></i> and <i><strong>a gearwheel</strong></i>, so be careful not to take <i><strong>two consecutive</strong></i> hits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383970/extras/6b43607759f01b8263025fb2c59829d0.poster.avif?t=1736636802\" width=712 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383970/extras/6b43607759f01b8263025fb2c59829d0.webm?t=1736636802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383970/extras/6b43607759f01b8263025fb2c59829d0.mp4?t=1736636802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ryo fires highly pressurized four-way <strong><i>steam cutters</i></strong> to attack its enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383970/extras/500c8d4b7da0115d4db9729a42eea78e.poster.avif?t=1736636802\" width=712 height=356 ><source src=\"